      "description": "The mobile tab appearance preserves readable labels and full-height targets.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Performance metric\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">New signups</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Revenue</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Product sales</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Active learners</button></div>",
